# Everything under public/ is copied verbatim into the build output and served,
# so any city network sitting there locally gets deployed whether the app uses
# it or not. .gitignore does not apply to Vercel uploads. Keep the deploy to the
# two cities the demo actually loads.
public/cities/*
!public/cities/buenos-aires.json
!public/cities/sao-paulo.json

# Local-only artefacts
.venv
data_viz.html
dist
